{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03565",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.35,
      "end_seconds": 6.38,
      "duration_seconds": 5.03,
      "text": "Hi, doctor, I came as soon as they called me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.93,
      "end_seconds": 11.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.79,
      "end_seconds": 15.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Mainly I've been sweating. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.17,
      "end_seconds": 20.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.41,
      "end_seconds": 25.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "It's, It's been about a week, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.16,
      "end_seconds": 36.54,
      "duration_seconds": 9.38,
      "text": "Right, can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.35,
      "end_seconds": 47.88,
      "duration_seconds": 10.53,
      "text": "It feels mild to me. It happens on and off. My sister suggested writing things down, uh, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.97,
      "end_seconds": 52.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.42,
      "end_seconds": 68.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.82,
      "end_seconds": 84.96,
      "duration_seconds": 7.14,
      "text": "Okay: pulse 107, respiratory rate 18, SpO2 97 percent on room air, pressure 135 over 86."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.79,
      "end_seconds": 92.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.46,
      "end_seconds": 101.45,
      "duration_seconds": 0.99,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.94,
      "end_seconds": 104.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.06,
      "end_seconds": 124.86,
      "duration_seconds": 5.8,
      "text": "You have brisk reflexes and jerking of the ankles, and your pupils are large."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.76,
      "end_seconds": 126.67,
      "duration_seconds": 0.91,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.71,
      "end_seconds": 133.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "You can relax now. Any seizure?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.41,
      "end_seconds": 137.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Not that I've noticed, no seizure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.83,
      "end_seconds": 144.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any stiffness or confusion?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.12,
      "end_seconds": 149.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "No, you know, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.47,
      "end_seconds": 153.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "I see, go ahead. Is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.63,
      "end_seconds": 158.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Bowels are regular, nothing odd."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.99,
      "end_seconds": 164.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.15,
      "end_seconds": 171.28,
      "duration_seconds": 5.13,
      "text": "Not currently, but as a youngster naproxen gave me a rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.09,
      "end_seconds": 190.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "Any inherited conditions that you know of in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.63,
      "end_seconds": 195.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "My mother had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.92,
      "end_seconds": 215.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.22,
      "end_seconds": 222.61,
      "duration_seconds": 5.39,
      "text": "Depression, for two years. I've never really been one for hospitals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.34,
      "end_seconds": 229.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "I see, go ahead. Any regular medication at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 230.59,
      "end_seconds": 233.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "No, I'm not on anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.25,
      "end_seconds": 236.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "Alright, any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.35,
      "end_seconds": 240.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "I gave up cigarettes last spring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.64,
      "end_seconds": 242.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 243.59,
      "end_seconds": 245.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.54,
      "end_seconds": 249.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Do you work outside the home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.78,
      "end_seconds": 255.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.64,
      "end_seconds": 259.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 260.59,
      "end_seconds": 263.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.06,
      "end_seconds": 269.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 270.88,
      "end_seconds": 274.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.55,
      "end_seconds": 286.05,
      "duration_seconds": 11.5,
      "text": "Putting it all together, I'd lean towards mild serotonin syndrome from combining medicines. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.52,
      "end_seconds": 303.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "I'm sending you for blood tests because of agitation and clonus."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 305.74,
      "end_seconds": 308.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "The earliest is Thursday, 3:30 pm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.63,
      "end_seconds": 333.92,
      "duration_seconds": 24.29,
      "text": "We will stop the migraine tablet and watch you for several hours. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. The thing that would worry me is if the symptoms get worse. If that happens, go to emergency. Come back in one day. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.87,
      "end_seconds": 341.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 342.61,
      "end_seconds": 343.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
}